<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Your OTP Code</title>
  </head>
  <body
    style="
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f3f7fb;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: #16324f;
    "
  >
    <div
      style="
        display: none;
        max-height: 0;
        overflow: hidden;
        opacity: 0;
        visibility: hidden;
      "
    >
      Your verification code is <%= otp %>. It expires in 2 minutes.
    </div>

    <table
      role="presentation"
      cellpadding="0"
      cellspacing="0"
      width="100%"
      style="background-color: #f3f7fb; padding: 32px 16px"
    >
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <table
            role="presentation"
            cellpadding="0"
            cellspacing="0"
            width="100%"
            style="
              max-width: 620px;
              background: #ffffff;
              border-radius: 24px;
              overflow: hidden;
              box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(17, 43, 70, 0.12);
            "
          >
            <tr>
              <td
                style="
                  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f6cbd 0%, #19a974 100%);
                  padding: 32px 36px;
                  color: #ffffff;
                "
              >
                <div
                  style="
                    display: inline-block;
                    padding: 8px 14px;
                    border-radius: 999px;
                    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
                    font-size: 12px;
                    font-weight: 700;
                    letter-spacing: 1px;
                    text-transform: uppercase;
                  "
                >
                  Secure Verification
                </div>
                <h1
                  style="
                    margin: 18px 0 10px;
                    font-size: 30px;
                    line-height: 1.2;
                    font-weight: 700;
                  "
                >
                  Your one-time password
                </h1>
                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0;
                    font-size: 16px;
                    line-height: 1.7;
                    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
                  "
                >
                  Use the code below to continue safely in your healthcare
                  account.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 36px">
                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 14px;
                    font-size: 18px;
                    line-height: 1.7;
                    color: #16324f;
                  "
                >
                  Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>,
                </p>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 28px;
                    font-size: 15px;
                    line-height: 1.8;
                    color: #4c627a;
                  "
                >
                  We received a request that requires email verification. Enter
                  this OTP to proceed. For your security, the code is valid for
                  only <strong>2 minutes</strong>.
                </p>

                <div
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 28px;
                    padding: 22px 20px;
                    border-radius: 18px;
                    background: #eef7ff;
                    border: 1px solid #d6e9fb;
                    text-align: center;
                  "
                >
                  <div
                    style="
                      margin-bottom: 10px;
                      font-size: 12px;
                      letter-spacing: 1.4px;
                      text-transform: uppercase;
                      color: #5b7897;
                      font-weight: 700;
                    "
                  >
                    One-Time Password
                  </div>
                  <div
                    style="
                      font-size: 34px;
                      line-height: 1;
                      font-weight: 700;
                      letter-spacing: 10px;
                      color: #0f6cbd;
                    "
                  >
                    <%= otp %>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 14px;
                    font-size: 14px;
                    line-height: 1.8;
                    color: #4c627a;
                  "
                >
                  If you did not request this code, you can safely ignore this
                  email. No changes will be made to your account without
                  verification.
                </p>

                <div
                  style="
                    margin-top: 28px;
                    padding-top: 20px;
                    border-top: 1px solid #e8eef5;
                    font-size: 13px;
                    line-height: 1.8;
                    color: #74879b;
                  "
                >
                  This is an automated security email. Please do not reply.
                </div>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
